{"text":"莊嚴寺。在東陽門外一里御道北。所謂東安里也。北為租場里。內有駙馬都尉司馬恍。濟州刺史分宣。幽州刺史李真奴。豫州刺史公孫驤等四宅。","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"駙馬都尉","refId":null,"text":"駙馬都尉","start":30,"end":34},{"name":"Office","term":"司馬","refId":null,"text":"司馬","start":34,"end":36},{"name":"Udef_Governor","term":"濟州刺史","refId":null,"text":"濟州刺史","start":38,"end":42},{"name":"Udef_Governor","term":"幽州刺史","refId":null,"text":"幽州刺史","start":45,"end":49},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"李","refId":null,"text":"李","start":49,"end":50},{"name":"Udef_Governor","term":"豫州刺史","refId":null,"text":"豫州刺史","start":53,"end":57}]}